{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-model-proxy#card-zh","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-model-proxy","commit":"d4325126722c27ed32f14bef5d999a3011739346","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-proxy 是一款面向 DSH 的模型路由插件：它接管进程的 undici 全局 dispatcher，按请求目标主机及 JSON 请求体中的模型名决定是否通过配置的 HTTP(S) 代理发送。主要功能包括按 origin 限定路由范围、用通配符匹配模型、探测代理连通性并在代理不可用时保留原路由，以及卸载时恢复先前 dispatcher。适合需要让同一 API 网关中的部分模型走不同出口的 DSH 用户；需要配置可访问的代理端点、允许的主机和模型模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:283-310","index.js:350-389","cordis.patch.yml:10-24"]}
{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-model-proxy#card-en","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-model-proxy","commit":"d4325126722c27ed32f14bef5d999a3011739346","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-proxy routes selected DSH requests through a proxy using destination host and model name. It supports wildcard patterns, checks proxy reachability, falls back to the prior route when unavailable, and restores the dispatcher on unload. Set the proxy, allowed origins, and model patterns.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:283-310","index.js:350-389","cordis.patch.yml:10-24"]}
