{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-model-proxy#feature-1","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-model-proxy","commit":"d4325126722c27ed32f14bef5d999a3011739346","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-proxy 的功能「按模型选择代理」：对指定 origin 的非 GET/HEAD 请求读取请求体中的 model 字段；匹配配置的模型模式时通过代理 dispatcher 转发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:283-310"]}
{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-model-proxy#feature-2","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-model-proxy","commit":"d4325126722c27ed32f14bef5d999a3011739346","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-proxy 的功能「代理不可用时回退」：配置启用回退后，插件探测代理 TCP 端口；无法连接时匹配请求仍经安装前的 dispatcher 发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:234-254","index.js:287-302"]}
{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-model-proxy#feature-3","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-model-proxy","commit":"d4325126722c27ed32f14bef5d999a3011739346","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-proxy 的功能「卸载时恢复原路由」：插件卸载时若当前全局 dispatcher 仍是自身安装的实例，就恢复被替换的 dispatcher 并关闭代理路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:382-388"]}
